            "review_title": "Review at O2O Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "lifeononewaytickets\nHamilton, New Zealand293 contributions\n1\nballoon, shisha, drink & a whole lot of fun!\nNov 2018 • Friends\nThis is one of the stops we came on the Hanoi Pub Crawl! They did not disappoint, everyone was able to do what they wanted at this bar! I played darts for a bit, danced the night away and had some hoots on the shisha! The drink specials kept my wallet happy and my head hurting the next day lol. Cool place to interact with the stylish Vietnamese and the people on the crawl as it’s a smaller venue.\nRead more\nWritten November 3, 2018",
